Package: fleetwright
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, tmux, curl, ca-certificates, sudo, tar, gzip
Recommends: podman, uidmap
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/TheTechNetwork/Fleetwright
Description: Fleetwright host: Claude Code sessions a fleet can reach
 The session manager (agent-hub), the fleet sidecar and the MCP server, laid
 out under /opt/fleetwright exactly as the one-line installer lays them out,
 with the Node runtime they need carried in /usr/lib/fleetwright/node.
 .
 Only stable releases whose rollout is complete are published here. A box
 installed from this package takes its updates from apt.
